```

**`changes.Modified` is completely ignored.** The modified files come exclusively from transcript parsing via:
- Line 229: `claudecode.ExtractAllModifiedFilesFromLines(transcriptLines, ...)`
- Line 233: `extractModifiedFiles(transcriptLines)` (fallback)

**However, in `handleClaudeCodePostTodo()`, it IS used:**

```go
// Line 459 - checks changes.Modified
if len(changes.Modified) == 0 && len(changes.New) == 0 && len(changes.Deleted) == 0 {
    fmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, "[entire] No file changes detected, skipping incremental checkpoint\n")
